# Third-party sources of the TP4 images (Dockerfile.canary, Dockerfile.canary-roce).
#
# Third-party engine sources are downloaded at pinned commits by scripts/fetch_runtime.sh.
# The public B12X RoCE ring package is maintained separately in the parent spark/ring/b12x
# directory and copied from the `spark-ring` build context. The Dockerfiles run the fetcher in
# their `fetch` stage; run it on a host to inspect or diff target-specific sources:
#   scripts/fetch_runtime.sh runtime/fetched            # all components
#   scripts/fetch_runtime.sh runtime/fetched b12x-next  # one component
#
# Columns: component  source-commit  sha256-of-the-downloaded-file  url
# (the url always names the same commit; the script checks that). `local` rows at the end
# list files kept in this repository: local  path  sha256  -

# SGLang dsv4.1 branch, python/ tree only (2026-09-16 19:45 UTC). Apache-2.0.
sglang-canary  f80c91a4b97e52e17fbcff088aa6b47b6270f6b9  9968fcff7fa8218b8246a4553d72933b08f4846550e7c5b6a891bdc3bdc881a8  https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/archive/f80c91a4b97e52e17fbcff088aa6b47b6270f6b9.tar.gz

# b12x as frozen for rhys101's SG17 RoCEnante overlay (b12x.comm.roce); published as a source
# archive in rhys101/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-vLLM-DGX-Spark-8, provenance in
# runtime/b12x/source-provenance.json. Apache-2.0 (local-inference-lab/b12x).
b12x-sg17  66aa6bd5085e63bbb011557075765e3191e807b2  4922d0db9395fb8b537d7e216d509a5747867a45f20c18290e385786609dd05f  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rhys101/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-vLLM-DGX-Spark-8/66aa6bd5085e63bbb011557075765e3191e807b2/sglang/experiments/sg17-rocenante/b12x-source.tar.gz

# b12x main, installed as the top-level package b12x_next beside the SG17 copy (renamed
# identifiers, B12X_* knobs -> B12X_NEXT_*), then scripts/b12x_next-compact-n64-m64.patch.
# adapter/moe_b12x_next.py refuses any other commit. Apache-2.0.
b12x-main  a7d7d29b2ef8869086e0ceaa787321f17544e3c9  e2d070850d50fb365a01f82f16e3f582a53e7ad1c6e3d657b50babb68814635d  https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x/archive/a7d7d29b2ef8869086e0ceaa787321f17544e3c9.tar.gz

